{"id":"posiblemente","lemma":"posiblemente","pos":"adv","rank":1940,"glosses":["possibly"],"ipa":"/poˌsibleˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-posiblemente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Posiblemente pueda haber habido un malentendido.","en":"There may have been a misunderstanding.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804030"},{"text":"Él posiblemente esté equivocado.","en":"He's probably wrong."},{"text":"Tom posiblemente tenga cáncer.","en":"Tom might have cancer."},{"text":"Posiblemente no pueda venir.","en":"I might not be able to come."},{"text":"Posiblemente haga buen día mañana.","en":"It may possibly be fine tomorrow."}]}